    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, memories dont matter when the world has already moved on and deleted the old version of me. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person. i just see a shell of someone who doesn't exist anymore. it's like i'm already dead, right? just waiting for the rest of me to catch up.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
